    "detailed_description": "BrightSeeker is an action RPG set in a futuristic fantasy world where people and their mechanical constructs rose up against their gods. Fight your way through hordes of deadly mechanical soldiers as the Seeker \u2014 the last descendant of the ancient gods \u2014 who lost their only companion to these machines. Take your revenge and find a way to bring your loved one back to life...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/c0aba1a78e36eceec8c34956670ea941.webp?t=1729154877\" /></div><br><strong>Shoot, slash and dash to defeat numerous enemies.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/5d4269008afea9ff1fc89994b9b90cd7.poster.avif?t=1729154877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/5d4269008afea9ff1fc89994b9b90cd7.webm?t=1729154877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/5d4269008afea9ff1fc89994b9b90cd7.mp4?t=1729154877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Block projectiles with your shield. Time your blocks well and deflect the projectiles back at your enemies.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/a548237cc0c61bf6a55206e073f87952.poster.avif?t=1729154877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/a548237cc0c61bf6a55206e073f87952.webm?t=1729154877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/a548237cc0c61bf6a55206e073f87952.mp4?t=1729154877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/bf831ba11984d912f5d79a48dd9ad0d2.webp?t=1729154877\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/c23192d1c4bacf12fb6393c5032e9324.webp?t=1729154877\" /></div><br><strong>Upgrade and modify your abilities to suit your own play-style and make them even more powerful.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/0ccf6ddafef3133c12f1e0b4313c1e32.poster.avif?t=1729154877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/0ccf6ddafef3133c12f1e0b4313c1e32.webm?t=1729154877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/0ccf6ddafef3133c12f1e0b4313c1e32.mp4?t=1729154877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/069fbb953ac629a1ecc8da07cf88b935.poster.avif?t=1729154877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/069fbb953ac629a1ecc8da07cf88b935.webm?t=1729154877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/069fbb953ac629a1ecc8da07cf88b935.mp4?t=1729154877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/bf831ba11984d912f5d79a48dd9ad0d2.webp?t=1729154877\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src