d.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/82df94ec02ee24bc9b97d00441e8a202.mp4?t=1729154877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Unlock new abilities for enemies to make them more challenging to defeat or give yourself boosts to make the game easier. The game will be only as difficult/easy as you make it.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/45999e54c5a50d0452995a6eb8c5dc5f.poster.avif?t=1729154877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/45999e54c5a50d0452995a6eb8c5dc5f.webm?t=1729154877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/45999e54c5a50d0452995a6eb8c5dc5f.mp4?t=1729154877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491950/extras/bf831ba11984d912f5d79a48dd9ad0d2.webp?t=1729154877\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Shoot, slash and dash to defeat deadly enemies.<br></li><li>Block and deflect projectiles with a shield.<br></li><li>Unlock powerful special abilities.<br></li><li>Customize your weapons in The Ability Forge.<br></li><li>Vanquish challenging bosses.<br></li><li>Play at your own difficulty level.<br></li><li>Explore the futuristic world.</li></ul>",
